{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>משליח.</b> A strange word, from the heavy [i.e., piel] conjugation." "And the word ערוב [means] harmful beasts mixed together, such as lions, wolves, bears, and leopards." "And the sense of גם האדמה [is] the place where there are no houses."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "The term הבנן הכבד (or הכבד) refers to the piel binyan; rendered literally as Ibn Ezra's technical designation."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:39.269442290Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}